# FORLORN HOPE: the code SLIM-PICK, entered on the CODE screen, sends each
# run out with only three of the five trades, picked at random. A run begun
# with it on earns no goals and keeps no records.
seed 7
game forlorn
wait 20
press DOWN
press DOWN
expect title_sel == 2
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
